// The Dominion dreadnought (`aster_t4_dreadnought`): its spinal AEB, the biggest gun a
// ship carries. The charge is the Resolute's banks at a larger scale and plainly a bore's:
// eight coils come up one after another down the spine (as their light climbs it,
// `titan_charge`), each a contactor slam, an arc round the ring, a thump a notch higher
// and a short thunder roll, over a transformer growl and the bore's own stack climbing the
// whole five seconds, the air crackling thicker toward the shot and a sub swell at the
// top. The discharge and the strike are the AEB-3's (`titan.ron`), the discharge a size
// larger. Every Roll has a pinned seed (see heavy_rail.ron).
